  "body": "Privacy, sunshine, sea views and a generous 745sqm freehold site, all within a very short walk from school - 12 Delshaw Avenue delivers the combination families rarely find at this price point. Elevated to capture expansive views, this family home offers front and rear decks for outdoor entertaining, a private backyard for the kids and those long summer evenings spent firing up the BBQ. And for busy families, the location is hard to beat, with Whangaparaoa College just down the street, making school mornings that much easier.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Four good sized bedrooms\r\n* Open plan lounge and dining with sea views\r\n* Sliding doors connect living directly to the sunny deck\r\n* 745sqm freehold site with a private backyard\r\n* Durable timber interior with plenty of warmth and character\r\n* Heat pump for convenient heating and cooling\r\n* Front and rear decks for outdoor living\r\n* Carport plus additional off-street parking\r\n* Additional lined storage space under the house, perfect for tools and toys\r\n\r\nThe location makes everyday family life easy, with Whangaparaoa's Coast shopping centre close by for groceries, cafes and all essentials. With beaches, coastal walks and recreational attractions of the Whangaparaoa Peninsula all within easy reach, this is an excellent entry-level family home with the lifestyle to match. With the ongoing construction of Penlink set to improve connectivity to this coastal community, now is the time to buy here!\r\n\r\nCome and explore the space, views and lifestyle on offer at 12 Delshaw Avenue.\r\n\r\nDEADLINE SALE: Closes Wednesday 11th November at 4:00pm (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/B5Q5\r\n\r\nFlexible settlement terms available.\r\nOther agents - bring your buyers. Conjunctionals welcome.\r\nBuilding report available\r\n\r\nPlease note: Some images have been virtually staged for marketing purposes",
